#: ../../mcp.md:1
msgid "MCP"
msgstr "MCP"

#: ../../mcp.md:3
msgid ""
"minacode can connect to [Model Context "
"Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) servers and call their tools "
"through its `MCP` tool. Servers can be **remote** (HTTP) or **local** "
"(stdio), and <span class=\"marker\">nothing about a server reaches the "
"model until you connect it</span>."
msgstr ""
"minacode 可以连接 [Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) "
"server，并通过 `MCP` 工具调用其工具。Server "
"可以是**远程**（HTTP）或**本地**（stdio）；在主动连接之前，<span class=\"marker\">该 server "
"的任何信息都不会进入模型 context</span>。"

#: ../../mcp.md:8
msgid "Configuring servers"
msgstr "配置 server"

#: ../../mcp.md:10
msgid "Each server is an `[mcp.<name>]` block."
msgstr "每个 server 对应一个 `[mcp.<name>]` 配置块。"

#: ../../mcp.md:12
msgid "Remote (HTTP)"
msgstr "远程（HTTP）"

#: ../../mcp.md:22
msgid "Local (stdio)"
msgstr "本地（stdio）"

#: ../../mcp.md:32
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "配置项"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Applies to"
msgstr "适用范围"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`url`"
msgstr "`url`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "remote"
msgstr "远程"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Server endpoint (mutually exclusive with `command`)"
msgstr "Server endpoint（不能与 `command` 同时设置）"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`command`, `args`"
msgstr "`command`, `args`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "local"
msgstr "本地"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Program and arguments to launch"
msgstr "要启动的程序和参数"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`env`"
msgstr "`env`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Extra environment variables for the subprocess"
msgstr "传给子进程的额外环境变量"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`auth = \"oauth\"`"
msgstr "`auth = \"oauth\"`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Authenticate via interactive OAuth"
msgstr "通过交互式 OAuth 认证"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`bearer_token_env_var`"
msgstr "`bearer_token_env_var`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Send `Authorization: Bearer <env var>`"
msgstr "发送 `Authorization: Bearer <env var>`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`env_http_headers`"
msgstr "`env_http_headers`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Map of HTTP header → env var holding its value"
msgstr "HTTP header 到保存其值的环境变量映射"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "`auto_connect`"
msgstr "`auto_connect`"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "both"
msgstr "两者"

#: ../../mcp.md
msgid "Connect at startup instead of on demand (default `false`)"
msgstr "启动时连接，而不是按需连接（默认 `false`）"

#: ../../mcp.md:44
msgid "Connecting"
msgstr "连接"

#: ../../mcp.md:46
msgid ""
"Servers are <span class=\"marker\"><strong>manual by "
"default</strong></span> — they stay inactive, and cost nothing, until you"
" connect them. Set `auto_connect = true` for servers you always want. "
"Ways to connect:"
msgstr ""
"Server <span "
"class=\"marker\"><strong>默认手动连接</strong></span>：连接前保持未激活，也不会占用 "
"token。对始终需要的 server，可设置 `auto_connect = true`。连接方式包括："

#: ../../mcp.md:50
msgid "**`/mcp`** — open the interactive manager and toggle a server on or off."
msgstr "**`/mcp`** — 打开交互式管理器，切换 server 的连接状态。"

#: ../../mcp.md:52
msgid ""
"MCP server manager listing all configured servers and their connection "
"status"
msgstr "MCP server 管理器列出全部已配置 server 及其连接状态"

#: ../../mcp.md:57
msgid "The /mcp interactive server manager."
msgstr "`/mcp` 交互式 server 管理器。"

#: ../../mcp.md:59
msgid ""
"**`@server`** in a message — connect on demand. The connection remains "
"active until you disconnect it."
msgstr "在消息中输入 **`@server`** — 按需连接。连接会保持，直到主动断开。"

#: ../../mcp.md:62
msgid "Using @server mention to connect an MCP server on demand"
msgstr "使用 `@server` 引用按需连接 MCP server"

#: ../../mcp.md:67
msgid "Connecting a server on demand with an @-mention."
msgstr "通过 `@` 引用按需连接 server。"

#: ../../mcp.md:69
msgid ""
"**`/mcp connect <server> [server ...]`** / **`/mcp disconnect <server>`**"
" — terminal fallbacks."
msgstr ""
"**`/mcp connect <server> [server ...]`** / **`/mcp disconnect <server>`**"
" — 终端命令形式。"

#: ../../mcp.md:71
msgid "**`/mcp tools [server]`** — list the tools of connected servers."
msgstr "**`/mcp tools [server]`** — 列出已连接 server 的工具。"

#: ../../mcp.md:73
msgid ""
"Connecting several servers in one command runs them concurrently; "
"interactive OAuth browser flows are serialized so they do not interfere "
"with each other."
msgstr "一条命令连接多个 server 时会并发执行；交互式 OAuth 浏览器流程会串行进行，避免互相干扰。"

#: ../../mcp.md:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Once a server is connected, minacode can use its tools like any other. "
"Tools the server marks read-only run without a prompt; anything that may "
"change state asks for {ref}`confirmation <built-in-guardrails>` first."
msgstr ""
"连接后，minacode 可以像使用其他工具一样使用该 server 的工具。Server "
"标记为只读的工具无需确认即可运行；可能改变状态的操作会先请求{ref}`确认 <built-in-guardrails>`。"

#: ../../mcp.md:80
msgid "Scripting tool calls"
msgstr "脚本化工具调用"

#: ../../mcp.md:82
msgid ""
"When the agent expects several <span class="marker">same-shape MCP "
"calls</span> — the same tool with a handful of different arguments — the "
"`ToolScript` tool lets it write one Python script instead of emitting "
"each call separately. Only what the script prints returns to the "
"conversation, so a batch of calls collapses into a single result. "
"`ToolScript` is always available; the MCP entries below need a connected "
"server."
msgstr "当 agent 预期要发出若干次<span class=\"marker\">形状相同的 MCP 调用</span>——同一工具搭配少量不同参数——`ToolScript` 工具让它写一个 Python 脚本,而不是逐个发出调用。只有脚本 print 的内容会回到对话中,于是一批调用坍缩成一个结果。`ToolScript` 始终可用;下面的 MCP 条目需要已连接的 server。"

#: ../../mcp.md:88
msgid "Describing shapes in bulk"
msgstr "批量描述形状"

#: ../../mcp.md:90
msgid ""
"`ToolScript(action="describe", tools=[...])` batch-reports each tool's "
"call shape and a json gate. A list entry is either a built-in tool name "
"like `"Read"` or an MCP tool as `"server.tool"`:"
msgstr "`ToolScript(action=\"describe\", tools=[...])` 批量报告每个工具的调用形状与 json gate。列表条目可以是内置工具名(如 `\"Read\"`)或 `\"server.tool\"` 形式的 MCP 工具:"

#: ../../mcp.md:94
msgid ""
"`json: yes` — the server declared an `outputSchema`, so `format=\"json\"`"
" below can rely on it."
msgstr "`json: yes` — server 声明了 `outputSchema`,因此下面的 `format=\"json\"` 可以依赖它。"

#: ../../mcp.md:95
msgid ""
"`json: unknown` — no declared schema; `format=\"json\"` will try to parse"
" the returned text and may fail."
msgstr "`json: unknown` — 未声明 schema;`format=\"json\"` 会尝试解析返回的文本,可能失败。"

#: ../../mcp.md:97
msgid ""
"`json: no` — built-in tools: scriptable with `format=\"text\"`, but no "
"structured return yet."
msgstr "`json: no` — 内置工具:可用 `format=\"text\"` 脚本化,但暂无结构化返回。"

#: ../../mcp.md:99
msgid ""
"The MCP rendering matches `MCP(action=\"describe\")` with the gate line "
"added; built-in entries are compact one-liners with their parameter "
"essentials. Either way, a shape learned here is what a scripted call will"
" actually receive."
msgstr "MCP 条目的渲染与 `MCP(action=\"describe\")` 一致,只是多了一行 gate;内置条目是带参数要点的紧凑单行。无论哪种,在这里学到的形状就是脚本化调用实际会收到的。"

#: ../../mcp.md:103
msgid "Running a script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../mcp.md:105
msgid ""
"`ToolScript(action=\"call\", code=\"...\")` runs the code as Python. "
"Inside it, `call()` invokes a tool — built-in or MCP:"
"`ToolScript(action=\"call\", code=\"...\")` 以 Python 运行该代码。在其中,`call()` "
"调用一个 MCP 工具:"
msgstr "`ToolScript(action=\"call\", code=\"...\")` 以 Python 运行该代码。在其中,`call()` 调用一个工具——内置或 MCP:"

#: ../../mcp.md:118
msgid ""
"`call(name, args, format="text")` — `name` is a built-in tool like "
"`"Read"`, `"Bash"`, or `"Edit"`, or `"MCP"` for a server tool. "
"`Delegate`, `Job`, and `ToolScript` itself cannot be nested. "
"`format="text"` returns the rendered result; MCP calls may use "
"`format="json"` for a parsed dict, while built-ins refuse it until they"
" gain structured results (`<name> does not support format="json"`)."
msgstr "`call(name, args, format=\"text\")` — `name` 是内置工具名,如 `\"Read\"`、`\"Bash\"` 或 `\"Edit\"`,也可以是 `\"MCP\"` 表示 server 工具。`Delegate`、`Job` 与 `ToolScript` 自身不可嵌套。`format=\"text\"` 返回渲染后的结果;MCP 调用可用 `format=\"json\"` 拿到解析后的 dict,内置工具在获得结构化返回前会拒绝(`<name> does not support format=\"json\"`)。"

#: ../../mcp.md:123
msgid ""
"Nested calls go through the <span class=\"marker\">same confirmation, "
"live logging, and `tr.N` retention as top-level calls</span>, and they "
"never add extra tool messages — the agent still sees exactly one result "
"per call it emitted."
msgstr ""
"嵌套调用走与顶层调用<span class=\"marker\">相同的确认、实时日志与 `tr.N` 保留</span>,并且绝不会产生额外的 "
"tool message——agent 仍然恰好为它发出的每个调用看到一条结果。"

#: ../../mcp.md:126
msgid ""
"The result envelope lists the nested `tr.N` keys, so a shortened output "
"can still be recalled."
msgstr "结果信封会列出嵌套的 `tr.N` key,因此被截短的输出仍可被 Recall。"

#: ../../mcp.md:127
msgid ""
"Refusing a nested call aborts the script; the rest of the outer batch "
"continues."
msgstr "拒绝一次嵌套调用会中止脚本;外层批次的其余调用继续执行。"

#: ../../mcp.md:128
msgid ""
"A script that fails returns with a traceback (source lines included) so "
"the agent can correct itself."
msgstr "失败的脚本会带着 traceback(含出错行源码)返回,以便 agent 自行修正。"

#: ../../mcp.md:130
msgid ""
"Pure script execution is budgeted at about 60 seconds, excluding time "
"spent inside nested calls."
msgstr "纯脚本执行约有 60 秒的预算,不包括嵌套调用内部耗时。"

#: ../../mcp.md:133
msgid "The json gate in practice"
msgstr "json gate 的实际行为"

#: ../../mcp.md:135
msgid ""
"Built-in tools report `json: no` and take `format=\"text\"` only: "
"`format=\"json\"` refuses with `<name> does not support format=\"json\"`."
" For MCP calls, `format=\"json\"` prefers the server's declared "
"`structuredContent`. Two errors are possible:"
msgstr "内置工具标 `json: no`,只接受 `format=\"text\"`:`format=\"json\"` 会以 `<name> does not support format=\"json\"` 拒绝。对 MCP 调用,`format=\"json\"` 优先取 server 声明的 `structuredContent`。可能有两种错误:"

#: ../../mcp.md:139
msgid ""
"The tool declared an `outputSchema` but the call returned no "
"`structuredContent` — reported as `server declared outputSchema but no "
"structuredContent`."
msgstr ""
"工具声明了 `outputSchema`,但调用没有返回 `structuredContent` — 报告为 `server declared "
"outputSchema but no structuredContent`。"

#: ../../mcp.md:141
msgid ""
"No schema was declared and the returned text is not JSON — reported as "
"`MCP returned text that is not JSON`."
msgstr "未声明 schema 且返回的文本不是 JSON — 报告为 `MCP returned text that is not JSON`。"

#: ../../mcp.md:144
msgid "Safety"
msgstr "安全"

#: ../../mcp.md:146
msgid ""
"The script is <span class=\"marker\">not sandboxed</span>: it runs with "
"the same privileges as `Bash`. `ToolScript` asks for confirmation on "
"every `action=\"call\"` and the prompt shows the script; `--yolo` skips "
"that confirmation exactly as it does for `Bash`."
msgstr ""
"脚本<span class=\"marker\">不是沙箱</span>:它与 `Bash` 拥有相同权限。`ToolScript` 对每次 "
"`action=\"call\"` 都会请求确认,提示会展示脚本;`--yolo` 会像跳过 `Bash` 一样跳过该确认。"

#: ../../mcp.md:150
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#: ../../mcp.md:152
msgid ""
"**Bearer token** — set `bearer_token_env_var` (or a custom header via "
"`env_http_headers`)."
msgstr ""
"**Bearer token** — 设置 `bearer_token_env_var`，或通过 `env_http_headers` 设置自定义"
" header。"

#: ../../mcp.md:153
msgid ""
"**OAuth** — set `auth = \"oauth\"`. Connecting runs the authorization "
"flow; disconnecting clears the saved login."
msgstr "**OAuth** — 设置 `auth = \"oauth\"`。连接时执行授权流程；断开连接会清除已保存的登录信息。"

#: ../../mcp.md:156
msgid "Trust"
msgstr "信任边界"

#: ../../mcp.md:158
msgid ""
"Local (stdio) servers run programs on your machine, and remote servers "
"receive whatever the agent sends them. Only connect servers you trust."
msgstr "本地（stdio）server 会在你的机器上运行程序，远程 server 会收到 agent 发给它的内容。只连接可信的 server。"

